# The two homes (Sam, 2026-11-11): boot shows the splash, then the main screen; HOME there opens the now-playing
# screen, the home from then on (a new song, HOME from elsewhere); the device keeps it through a reboot, the splash
# flowing into it; HOME again the main screen, kept too. A change while a song plays is kept only once all is silent
# (stopped, the tails over): a flash save stalls the audio (a crackle, Sam 2026-11-11).
expect splash 1
wait 1400
expect splash 0
expect home_now 0
expect home 1
tap HOME
wait 50
expect home_now 1
expect home 1
shot home-now.png
tap GLO
wait 50
expect home 0
tap HOME
wait 50
expect home_now 1
expect home 1
reboot
expect splash 1
wait 1400
expect home_now 1
expect home 1
tap PLAY
wait 3000
shot home-now-playing.png
tap HOME
wait 50
expect home_now 0
wait 2000
expect home_kept 0
tap PLAY
wait 2000
expect home_kept 1
reboot
wait 1400
expect home_now 0
expect home 1
